and reporting requirements change over time, so students should use the latest applicable standards when preparing actual reports."},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6 — Internship & Capstone"},{"type":"p","text":"Complete:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainability/ESG internship"},{"text":"Carbon-footprint exercise"},{"text":"ESG dashboard"},{"text":"Sustainability report"},{"text":"Environmental improvement plan"},{"text":"Final capstone"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["graduate with environmental knowledge","business understanding","data/reporting skills."],"sep":"+","label":"The goal is to"}]},{"heading":"Core Sustainability Concepts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Balance:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Economic Development","Environmental Protection","Social Wellbeing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Circular Economy"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Take","Make","Use","Dispose"]},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reduce","Reuse","Repair","Remanufacture","Recycle","Recover"]},{"type":"h","text":"Resource Efficiency"},{"type":"p","text":"Reduce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Water consumption"},{"text":"Material use"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"Emissions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"while maintaining required operational performance."}]},{"heading":"Climate Change","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Greenhouse gases"},{"text":"Carbon dioxide"},{"text":"Methane"},{"text":"Nitrous oxide"},{"text":"Global warming"},{"text":"Climate impacts"},{"text":"Mitigation"},{"text":"Adaptation"},{"text":"Climate resilience"},{"text":"Net-zero concepts"},{"text":"Carbon neutrality claims"},{"text":"Carbon removal awareness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Mitigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Reducing greenhouse-gas emissions or increasing removals."},{"type":"h","text":"Adaptation"},{"type":"p","text":"Adjusting systems and operations to climate impacts."}]},{"heading":"Carbon Accounting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Direct emissions from sources owned or controlled by the organization."},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Indirect emissions associated with purchased electricity, steam, heating or cooling, depending on the reporting methodology."},{"type":"h","text":"Scope 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Other value-chain emissions."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the general workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Activity Data","Emission Factor","Emissions Calculation","Consolidation","Verification/Review","Reporting"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a sample organizational GHG inventory using fictional or publicly available data."}]},{"heading":"ESG Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Environmental"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emissions"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"Waste"},{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Pollution"},{"text":"Climate risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee wellbeing"},{"text":"Diversity & inclusion"},{"text":"Human rights"},{"text":"Labour practices"},{"text":"Community impact"},{"text":"Supply-chain social risks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Governance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Board oversight"},{"text":"Anti-corruption"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Accountability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Sustainability Executive should understand that ESG is broader than environmental management."}]},{"heading":"Materiality Assessment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how organizations identify the sustainability issues that matter most."},{"type":"p","text":"Assess:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stakeholder importance"},{"text":"Bu